platform-power-manager (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ubuntu/Debian integration release (see CHANGELOG.md for the full list).
  * Packaging: D-Bus system policy moved to /usr/share/dbus-1/system.d
    (was /etc/dbus-1), man page added, byte-compilation handled by
    dh_python3, pytest suite now runs during the build.
  * Depends: gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5) and gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), i.e.
    Ubuntu 24.04 LTS or newer (Adw.AboutDialog / Adw.Dialog are required).
  * Tray: register with the StatusNotifierWatcher as soon as it appears
    (fixes a missing icon when autostart wins the race against GNOME's
    AppIndicator extension) and quit on window close when no tray exists.

 -- Platform Power contributors <noreply@example.invalid>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

platform-power-manager (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * i18n: source code UI strings are now in English (readable by any
    contributor); French is preserved as a full gettext translation
    (po/fr.po, 203 strings) and keeps displaying automatically on a
    French-locale system, matching the previous French-only behaviour.
  * Fix: three menu section titles contained a raw "&", which
    Adw.PreferencesGroup interprets as Pango markup and silently failed
    to render. Reworded using "and" instead, in both languages.
  * Fix: the polkit policy file had no xml:lang markers, so its actions
    always showed in French regardless of system locale. Now has
    English defaults with xml:lang="fr" overrides.

 -- Platform Power contributors <noreply@example.invalid>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

platform-power-manager (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security: harden the systemd unit (PrivateTmp, RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_UNIX,
    RestrictNamespaces, LockPersonality, MemoryDenyWriteExecute, SystemCallFilter).
  * Fix: set_charge_thresholds() now validates against the firmware's own min/max
    before writing anything, instead of silently reverting an out-of-range value.
  * Fix: DaemonClient.watch_state_changed() now supports multiple subscribers, so
    the tray keeps receiving state updates after the window opens.
  * Tray: flyout submenus for thermal profile and charge mode, live checkmark
    updates via ItemsPropertiesUpdated, battery status shown in the menu.
  * Window: new primary menu (refresh, diagnostics, shortcuts, docs, report an
    issue, about).
  * First Debian/Ubuntu packaging, alongside the existing Fedora/RHEL RPM.

 -- Platform Power contributors <noreply@example.invalid>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

